sequenceDiagram
    participant Ops as Operations Team
    participant Monitor as Monitoring System
    participant Primary as Primary Site<br/>(us-east-1)
    participant DNS as DNS/Load Balancer
    participant DR as DR Site<br/>(us-west-2)
    participant DB as Database
    participant Users as End Users
    
    Note over Primary: Normal Operations
    Primary->>Monitor: Health Check OK
    Monitor->>Ops: System Healthy
    
    Note over Primary: Disaster Occurs
    Primary--xMonitor: Health Check Failed
    Monitor->>Monitor: 3 consecutive failures
    Monitor->>Ops: CRITICAL ALERT<br/>Primary Site Down
    
    Ops->>Ops: Assess Situation<br/>Declare Disaster
    Ops->>DR: Verify DR Site Ready
    DR->>Ops: DR Site Healthy
    
    Ops->>DB: Verify Latest Backup
    DB->>Ops: Backup Available<br/>RPO: 30 minutes
    
    Note over Ops,DR: BEGIN FAILOVER
    Ops->>DR: Initiate Failover Sequence
    
    DR->>DB: Restore from Latest Backup
    DB->>DR: Database Restored
    
    DR->>DR: Start Application Services
    DR->>DR: Run Health Checks
    DR->>Ops: Services Healthy
    
    Ops->>DR: Run Smoke Tests
    DR->>Ops: Tests Passed
    
    Ops->>DNS: Update DNS Records<br/>Point to DR Site
    DNS->>DNS: Propagate Changes<br/>(TTL: 60s)
    
    Note over Users: Users Experience Brief Downtime
    
    Users->>DNS: Request api.nexusos.io
    DNS->>Users: Resolve to DR Site IP
    Users->>DR: API Request
    DR->>Users: Response (200 OK)
    
    Ops->>Monitor: Enable Enhanced Monitoring
    Monitor->>DR: Continuous Health Checks
    
    loop Every 15 minutes
        DR->>Monitor: Metrics & Logs
        Monitor->>Ops: Status Dashboard
    end
    
    Note over Ops,DR: Service Restored<br/>RTO: 4 hours achieved
    
    Ops->>Users: Send Communication<br/>"Service Restored"
    
    Note over Primary: Later: Primary Site Recovery
    Ops->>Primary: Assess & Rebuild
    Primary->>Ops: Site Restored
    
    Ops->>DR: Prepare for Failback
    DR->>Primary: Sync Data
    Primary->>DR: Sync Complete
    
    Ops->>DNS: Update DNS to Primary
    DNS->>Users: Resolve to Primary
    
    Users->>Primary: Resume Normal Operations
    Note over Primary: Normal Operations Restored
